Clean-room provenance (ADR-021, 2026-09-04)
-------------------------------------------

The three OpenSCAD-engine modes of this cartridge — `cup` (cup.scad),
`baseplate_scad` (baseplate.scad) and `lid` (lid.scad), with the geometry they
share in gridfinity_std.scad — were removed from this commons on 2026-09-04
because they descended from GPL-3.0 code, and have been RE-CREATED CLEAN-ROOM.

They were authored from a recorded final-result baseline (the manifest contract
and measured geometry of the removed version) and from the publicly documented
Gridfinity specification, WITHOUT ACCESS TO THE PRIOR IMPLEMENTATION OR TO ANY
UPSTREAM IMPLEMENTATION. The implementer did not read, fetch or consult the
removed cartridge, its git history, the archived satellite repository, or any
upstream OpenSCAD Gridfinity project, at any point.

The re-creation is not a port, a migration or a derivation of any third-party
implementation. It is MADFAM's own authoring of a public standard. The
verification that it meets the standard's dimensions and the recorded baseline's
envelope is in docs/CLEANROOM-VERIFICATION.md.

The two CadQuery modes (`bin`, `baseplate`, in main.py) were MADFAM-authored
from the same published standard and were never in scope for removal.

